<title>UK: Bremer LB sets 100 million mark Dec 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Bremer LB sets 100 million mark Dec 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Banque Generale Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BREMER LANDESBANK KREDITANSTALT OLDENBURG GZ</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    22.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.82    PAY DATE  L-22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.125     REOFFER    99.97     SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
